 de pesquisa","expt":"A research report."},{"w":"coastal town","pos":"word","pt":"coastal town","ex":"cidade litorânea","expt":"A coastal town."},{"w":"recovery plan","pos":"word","pt":"recovery plan","ex":"plano de recuperação","expt":"A recovery plan."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Was the bridge broken?** — A ponte estava quebrada?","**Yes, the storm broke it.** — Sim, a tempestade a quebrou.","**Who brought food to the workers?** — Quem levou comida aos trabalhadores?","**Sorry to keep you waiting.** — Desculpe a espera.","**Thanks for waiting.** — Obrigado por esperar.","**I’m afraid it’s sold out.** — Receio que esteja esgotado.","**Is that everything?** — É tudo?"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"hope","pt":"esperar, ter esperança","forms":[["I / you / we / they hope","I hope to travel."],["he / she / it hopes","She hopes to win."]]}]},{"type":"table","head":["Phrasal verb","Significado","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**break down**","quebrar (veículo)","The bus broke down. — O ônibus quebrou."]],"cap":"Phrasal verbs"}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"After the storm","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"After the storm","lines":[["Ana","Was the bridge broken?","A ponte estava quebrada?"],["Leo","Yes, the storm broke it.","Sim, a tempestade a quebrou."],["Ana","Who brought food to the workers?","Quem levou comida aos trabalhadores?"],["Leo","The locals did. They bought it in town.","Os moradores. Compraram na cidade."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Terminações do passado /t/ /d/ /ɪd/","items":[{"label":"Terminações do passado /t/ /d/ /ɪd/","note":"Pratique em voz alta.","words":[]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you bought yesterday.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I bought bread yesterday."},{"q":"Say what you brought to class.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I brought a notebook."},{"q":"Say what began.",